---
source: crates/deft-cli/../../tests/unit/help.rs
expression: "help::group(g.name)"
---
deft doc - commands (input -> output)
  info       doc -> report  Title, author, words, headings, tables, images
  from-html  html -> docx   Convert the content to a Word document
  from-md    md -> docx     Write a Word document with headings, lists, tables, images
  replace    docx -> docx   Find and replace text in Word, keeping the formatting
  to-html    doc -> html    Convert to a web page
  to-md      doc -> md      Convert to Markdown, keeping headings, lists and tables
  to-pdf     doc -> pdf     Typeset as PDF, content not layout [beta]
  to-text    doc -> txt     Extract plain text
More: deft doc <command> --help
